  title: Exploration - Materials
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>Material Exploration</b>


    Explore dangerous caves to collect
    rare materials needed for advanced technology and ship repairs.


    These areas
    are inhabited by hostile creatures. Although the monsters are not very intelligent,
    they are still dangerous and can overwhelm careless explorers.


    Stay alert
    while exploring deeper sections of the cave. Valuable materials are often found
    in the most dangerous areas.'
  isImageBig: 0
